 "text": "Customer Accounts | The Equity Customer Accounts - The Equity\nOpens in a new window Opens an external website Opens an external website in a new window\nThis website utilizes technologies such as cookies to enable essential site functionality, as well as for analytics, personalization, and marketing. To learn more, view the following link: Privacy Policy\nManage Preferences\nStorage Preferences\nMain\nRESOURCES\nAbout\nBrand Promise\nOur Story\nBoard of Directors\nCommunity Stewardship\nOur Timeline\nDonation Request Form\nGO Brands\nNews\nAgronomy\nGo to the Field Podcast\nAgronomy Resource Center\nPlanters Precision\nGreen Creek Drones\nCrop Protection\nApplication\nSafety\nSeed\nCrop Nutrition\nGO SMART\nGO Effect\nLocations & Staff\nEnergy\nEnergy Programs & Billing Options\nSubmit Delivery Request\nLubricants\nPropane Service Area\nRefined Fuel & Lubricants Service Area\nPropane Safety\nLocations & Staff\nFeed\nFeed Catalog\nBeef Feed Products\nDairy Feed Products\nGoat Feed Products\nMiscellaneous Feed Products\nShow Feed Products\nSwine Feed Products\nFeed Staff & Locations\nLivestock\nDeer\nBeef\nDairy\nEquine\nGoats\nPoultry\nRabbits\nSheep\nShow\nSwine\nManure & Composting\nLivestock Management - Contact Us\nGrain\nCash Bids\nFutures\nGO EDGE\nGrain Text Updates\nNews\nWeather\nContract Strategies\nGrain App\nAverage Price Program\nFinancing\nGO FLEX Application\nStore\nShop Online\nCurbside Pickup Ordering\nFeed Catalog\nAffiliates\nCareers\nLocations\nContact Us\nCustomer Accounts\nCareers\nLocations\nContact\nCustomer Accounts\nEFFINGHAM EQUITY CREDIT POLICY\nEffective August 1, 1992 , the credit policy of the Effingham Equity is as follows:\n1. The statement will cover purchases and payments for the calendar month. Statements to customers will be mailed approximately the 1st working day of the month.\n2. All products will be invoiced showing our net prices.\n3. A 5% LATE CHARGE will be added on all items if not paid by the 12th DAY OF THE MONTH following the statement date.\n4. A FINANCE CHARGE OF 2% , which is the equivalent to an ANNUAL PERCENTAGE RATE OF 24% , will be assessed monthly on all amounts unpaid from the prior month statement and each proceeding month until paid. ALL ACCOUNTS 90 DAYS OLD WILL BE SUBJECT TO COLLECTION PROCEDURES .\n5. Accounts with an unpaid balance, more than 30 days from the date of original statement, will be considered past due and will be sold on a CASH-ONLY BASIS .\nBOARD OF DIRECTORS\nEFFINGHAM EQUITY\nThe Equity\n201 W Roadway Ave\nPO Box 488\nEffingham, IL 62401\n1.217.342.4101\nAbout\nAgronomy\nEnergy\nFeed\nGrain\nFinance\nStore\nAffiliates\nCareers\nLocations\nContact\nCustomer Accounts\nEmployee Login\nVendors\nPrivacy & Terms of Service\n|\nCredit Policy\n|\nSite Map\n© 2026 The Equity - All rights reserved\nSearch for:\nMinimum 3 character allowed.",
